{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>The kos.</b> Like כוס חרבות. Some say it hides itself from human eyes, therefore it dwells in a place where there is no settlement." "<b>The shalach.</b> Some say: a bird whose nature is to cast its young." "<b>The yanshuf.</b> A bird that flies at twilight (neshef), for it does not see by day because of the glare of the sun's light."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:09:25.687389194Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}